  <p>Lulu can spend **hours playing sorting games** on her iPad and **commenting on TikTok** like it's her full-time job—even if she has a mountain of other things to do. Priorities.</p>

  <h2>If Lulu Were a Character...</h2>
  <p>She would be **Joy from Inside Out**—bubbly, energetic, a little chaotic, and filled with uncontrollable laughter. But with better fashion.</p>

